Subject: [PATCH] Keep channel hierarchy during latest and per-item refresh

A channel latest view (Home "Latest in <channel>") and the per-item
IChannelItemRefreshManager refresh reach existing items through the channel
root. Treating that root as the item's parent moved a materialised channel
episode out of its Season, cleared SeriesId/SeasonId/SeriesPresentationUniqueKey
on the next metadata save, and the latest prune then deleted the Series and
Season it no longer listed. Series.GetEpisodes (the all-series web Play queue)
then returned no items or 404.

Non-authoritative refreshes now keep an existing item's live parent in the same
channel, and the latest prune keeps the parent chain of every item it keeps.
